<title>USA: Whistler to buy Stanley Works garage unit.</title>
<headline>Whistler to buy Stanley Works garage unit.</headline>
<dateline>CHELMSFORD, Mass. 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Whistler Corp, a privately-held maker of radar detectors and auto security systems, said Thursday it has agreed to acquire the garage-related products unit of Stanley Works.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed, but Whistler said the deal should be completed in December.</p>
<p>The unit has operations in Michigan and Ohio and makes garage doors and openers, gate openers and related electronic systems, Whistler said.</p>
</text>
